Source: helixos-upgrade
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: HelixOS <helixos@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: helixos-upgrade
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, snapper, btrfs-progs, apt
Description: HelixOS major-release upgrades with no data loss (Surge->Arc->Flux)
 Snapshots the system, swaps apt sources to the next release suite,
 upgrades in stages, and leaves a GRUB-bootable fallback snapshot.
 /home is never touched by the upgrader.
